In this folder I have the following initialization notebooks to produces files for the input folder in our model:

Elkhorn Slough Model Grid- produces the model grid used in calculating the bathymetry and other initialization files
Elkhorn Slough Bathymetry - produces the bathymetry.bin file 
Elkhorn Slough Initial Condions- produces the THETA.IC, SALT.IC, and DO.IC files 
Elkhorn Slough External Forcing- produces EXF files needed 
Elkhorn Slough Boundary Conditions- produces OBCS files needed
